WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.350
Cleaning is not a collection of random fixes It is a
sequence of evidence-based

00:00:06.376 --> 00:00:13.071
decisions First understand the source problems Then

00:00:13.098 --> 00:00:18.641
apply only rules you can explain Keep raw values
when provenance

00:00:18.654 --> 00:00:25.972
matters And when the correct value is unknown do not
invent one A

00:00:25.985 --> 00:00:29.446
review flag is often more honest than an automatic
replacement
